# (not Bot1's); Bot1 picks its own Memnite: 2/1 - power only, the toughness unchanged - with first strike, while the Modifier stays
# 2/2 with none. The pump is over by Bot2's turn 4, and Bot2's combat then triggers nothing ("on your turn").

